 ('FULL_CLOSURE','All92payloads plus manifest and68 original-copy provenance pairs independently verified; original and copy bytes exact with distinct identities. Every finite input independently copied and triple observed; Source009 helper, compact4a718/full556b/manifest8b296 all exact.'),
 ('RUNNER_COMPLETE','Full runner functions and Results class inspected. Closed external pins/GO15/Source009 peer15/source55 flat manifest/projection10, exact25 IDs/body ASTs, Source cache absence, fixed runtime4 read guards, stdlib test loading only, ordered actual starts/terminals/subtests, diagnostic offsets/full UTF8, events4096/row1024, combined4MiB/32chunks/131072, exact before/after bytes/raw9. No skips/expected failure/unexpected success or fixture error may become successful.'),
 ('SOURCE_TESTS','Old19 method ASTs exact and six new causal projection controls Source-only reviewed. Actual25 suite includes synthetic5390 fixtures and2MiB boundary; no real Root metadata/current24/native/science claim. Mocked checker main preflight test cannot publish actual READY.'),
 ('PARENT_COMPLETE','Full9 PowerShell functions and main/catch/finally inspected. Strict UTF8/BOM/ordinal duplicate/no-float JSON, closed GO15/helper15/sourcepeer12, PS7 timing positive<=600 and60 reserve, once absences, resource1GiB/D10GB point age60 throughspawn, environment1thread, BASE-I-S-B-Xutf8/direct process owned streams64KiB each. Child cutoff52/drain57/physical60 receipt plus externalRoot physical supervision required; direct child reaping only no Job/descendant guarantee.'),
 ('PS_SYNTAX','Independent native ParseFile tool43cba7 reported zero errors and9functions; metadata syntax only, parent not executed.'),
